      "date": "2026-03-29T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "RSB Transmissions (I) Ltd. entered into Share Purchase and Subscription Agreement to acquire 41% stake in Setco Auto Systems Private Limited from Setco Automotive Limited (BSE:505075) for INR 2.6 billion.",
      "body": "RSB Transmissions (I) Ltd. entered into Share Purchase and Subscription Agreement to acquire 41% stake in Setco Auto Systems Private Limited from Setco Automotive Limited (BSE:505075) for INR 2.6 billion on March 28, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 1.85 billion will be paid by RSB Transmissions (I) Ltd. RSB Transmissions (I) Ltd. will pay an earnout/contingent payment of INR 710 million cash. As part of consideration, INR 2.56 billion is paid towards common equity of Setco Auto Systems Private Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Setco Auto Systems Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 6.63 billion. As of March 31, 2025, Setco Auto Systems Private Limited reported net liabilities of INR 6.96 billion.\n\nThe transaction has been approved by target board and approval of of",
